From d0a34f06580b6213a5a5cafe38037ad3b7b7ffbc Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: axon7-build <axon7-build@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:59:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 33/45] axon7: rild for Android 15 (radio AIDL via cuttlefish
 libril-modem-lib)

Android 15 drops IRadio < 1.4 and the tree built no rild at all
(RILJ: serviceProxy == null). rild_axon7 is the cuttlefish rild without
the modem simulator: it loads the Qualcomm RIL (vendor.rild.libpath),
and libril-modem-lib serves the radio AIDL HALs (HIDL 1.6 compat shim),
slot1 and slot2 (ril-daemon2 -c 2). The HIDL radio 1.1 entries go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FVN6i29oeF8XZDRKkkCQqG
Change-Id: I57f6adb484d3c2a93796f3edfc80fbaccf97e421
